  sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as EV-FLOW User
    actor Driver as EV Driver
    actor Planner as Business Planner
    participant UI as EV-FLOW Frontend
    participant Store as Session Storage / Memory
    participant Device as Browser / Device
    participant API as EV-FLOW API
    participant Xendit as Xendit Checkout
    participant TomTom as TomTom Traffic Tiles

    rect rgb(245,245,245)
      Note over User,API: 1. Access, authentication, and password recovery
      User->>UI: Open EV-FLOW

      alt Quick login
        User->>UI: Select demo persona
        UI->>API: Authenticate demo persona
        alt Driver persona
          API-->>UI: Access token and driver profile
          UI->>Store: Save authentication session
          UI-->>Driver: Open vehicle onboarding
        else Business Planner persona
          API-->>UI: Access token and planner profile
          UI->>Store: Save authentication session
          UI-->>Planner: Open /business-dashboard/demand-heatmap
        else Demo session rejected
          API-->>UI: Authentication error
          UI-->>User: Show unavailable-profile error
        end

      else Standard login
        User->>UI: Enter username and password
        UI->>UI: Validate required fields
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
        alt Login accepted
          API-->>UI: Access token and user profile
          UI->>Store: Save authentication session
          alt Driver account
            UI-->>Driver: Open /ev-driver/map
          else Planner account
            UI-->>Planner: Open /business-dashboard/demand-heatmap
          end
        else Login rejected
          API-->>UI: Authentication error
          UI-->>User: Show login error
        end

      else Registration
        User->>UI: Enter account and vehicle details
        UI->>UI: Validate account fields and terms
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/register
        alt Registration accepted
          API-->>UI: Access token and user profile
          UI->>Store: Save authentication session
          UI-->>Driver: Open /ev-driver/map
        else Registration rejected
          API-->>UI: Validation or conflict error
          UI-->>User: Show registration error
        end
      end

      opt Forgot password
        User->>UI: Submit registered email
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/forgot-password
        API-->>UI: Reset-email status
        UI-->>User: Show reset instructions
        User->>UI: Open reset link and enter new password
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/reset-password
        API-->>UI: Password-reset result
        UI-->>User: Return to login
      end
    end

    rect rgb(238,248,255)
      Note over Driver,API: 2. EV Driver onboarding
      UI->>API: GET /api/v1/ev-models
      API-->>UI: EV model list
      UI->>API: GET /api/v1/connectors
      API-->>UI: Connector type list
      opt Existing profile available
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/users/me
        API-->>UI: Saved vehicle and connector preferences
      end
      Driver->>UI: Select vehicle and main connector
      UI->>API: PATCH /api/v1/users/me
      alt Preferences saved
        API-->>UI: Updated driver profile
        UI->>Store: Update stored user profile
        UI-->>Driver: Open /ev-driver/map
      else Save failed
        API-->>UI: Profile-update error
        UI-->>Driver: Show retry or skip option
      end
    end

    rect rgb(235,245,255)
      Note over Driver,API: 3. Station discovery and live station details
      Driver->>UI: Open station map
      UI->>Device: Request current location
      Device-->>UI: Coordinates or permission status

      par Load filter metadata
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/connectors
        API-->>UI: Connector types
      and
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/speed-tiers
        API-->>UI: Speed tiers
      end

      alt Coordinates available
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/stations/nearby
        API-->>UI: Nearby station results
      else Coordinates unavailable or denied
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/stations
        API-->>UI: Station list
      end
      UI-->>Driver: Show map, area filters, and stations

      Driver->>UI: Select an SPKLU station
      par Load live station information
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/stations/{station_id}/status
        API-->>UI: Availability, connector status, and wait time
      and
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/stations/{station_id}/occupancy
        API-->>UI: Historical peak-hour occupancy
      end
      UI-->>Driver: Show station drawer and charging options

      alt Connector available
        UI-->>Driver: Show Charge Here Now
      else Connector occupied with estimate
        UI-->>Driver: Show Wait Here and estimated minutes
      else No usable connector
        UI-->>Driver: Show unavailable status
      end
    end

    rect rgb(245,240,255)
      Note over Driver,API: 4. Route charger planning and active navigation
      Driver->>UI: Open Plan Route
      UI->>Device: Read current location
      Device-->>UI: Coordinates or permission status

      opt Coordinates available
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/geocoding/reverse
        API-->>UI: Current-location label
      end

      Driver->>UI: Search origin or destination
      UI->>API: GET /api/v1/geocoding/search
      API-->>UI: Matching locations and stations
      Driver->>UI: Enter destination, battery, reserve, and preferences
      UI->>UI: Validate route and vehicle inputs
      UI->>API: POST /api/v1/route-plans

      alt Destination reachable directly
        API-->>UI: Route plan without charging stop
        UI-->>Driver: Show route simulation and arrival battery
      else Charging stop required
        API-->>UI: Route plan with recommended SPKLU
        UI-->>Driver: Show route, charging stop, and battery forecast
      else Invalid request or no suitable station
        API-->>UI: Route error
        UI-->>Driver: Show corrective action
      end

      opt Driver starts navigation
        UI-->>Driver: Open active navigation view
        loop During active navigation
          UI->>API: POST /api/v1/route-plans/active/evaluate
          API-->>UI: Updated battery and route assessment
          UI-->>Driver: Update guidance or replacement route
        end
      end

      opt Driver cancels, completes, or leaves navigation
        UI->>API: DELETE /api/v1/route-plans/{route_plan_id}
        API-->>UI: Route session closed
        UI-->>Driver: Return to route planner
      end
    end

    rect rgb(255,248,238)
      Note over Driver,Xendit: 5. Wallet, history, and top-up
      Driver->>UI: Open wallet

      par Load wallet information
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/wallet
        API-->>UI: Wallet balance
      and
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/wallet/topups
        API-->>UI: Top-up history
      and
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/charging/sessions
        API-->>UI: Charging history
      end
      UI-->>Driver: Show balance and transactions

      Driver->>UI: Enter top-up amount
      UI->>UI: Validate minimum amount
      UI->>API: POST /api/v1/wallet/topup

      alt Top-up created
        API-->>UI: topup_id, amount, invoice_url
        UI->>Xendit: Open hosted invoice URL
        Xendit-->>Driver: Show payment checkout

        loop Until paid or driver leaves
          UI->>API: GET /api/v1/wallet/topups/{topup_id}
          API-->>UI: Pending or paid status
        end
        UI-->>Driver: Show top-up success or waiting state
      else Top-up failed
        API-->>UI: Top-up error
        UI-->>Driver: Show top-up error
      end
    end

    rect rgb(240,255,240)
      Note over Driver,API: 6. Charging session
      Driver->>UI: Tap Charge Here or open Scan
      UI->>Device: Request camera access
      Device-->>UI: Camera permission and QR result

      alt QR detected
        UI-->>Driver: Open Initialise Charging
      else Driver enters station manually
        UI-->>Driver: Open Initialise Charging
      end

      UI->>Device: Read current location
      Device-->>UI: Coordinates or permission status
      UI->>API: GET /api/v1/stations/{station_id}
      API-->>UI: Station and connector details
      UI->>API: GET /api/v1/wallet
      API-->>UI: Wallet balance
      UI-->>Driver: Show connector and energy form

      Driver->>UI: Enter required kWh
      UI->>UI: Validate energy amount
      UI->>API: POST /api/v1/charging/quote
      API-->>UI: Energy cost, fee, total due, estimated time
      UI-->>Driver: Show quote

      Driver->>UI: Confirm and pay
      UI->>API: POST /api/v1/charging/sessions

      alt Wallet balance sufficient
        API-->>UI: Charging session and reserved deposit
        UI-->>Driver: Show plug-in prompt
        Driver->>UI: Start charging session

        loop Frontend charging simulation
          UI->>UI: Update delivered kWh, power, cost, and progress
          UI-->>Driver: Refresh charging status
        end

        alt Target reached or driver stops
          UI->>API: POST /api/v1/charging/sessions/{session_id}/settle
          API-->>UI: Actual cost, refund, updated balance
          UI-->>Driver: Show completion and receipt
        end
      else Insufficient balance
        API-->>UI: HTTP 402 insufficient balance
        UI-->>Driver: Show wallet-balance error
      else API error
        API-->>UI: Charging-session error
        UI-->>Driver: Show charging error
      end
    end

    rect rgb(250,245,250)
      Note over Driver,API: 7. EV Driver profile and logout
      Driver->>UI: Open profile
      par Load profile data
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/users/me
        API-->>UI: Driver profile
      and
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/ev-models
        API-->>UI: EV model options
      end
      UI-->>Driver: Show account, vehicle, connector, and consent settings

      opt Driver saves changes
        Driver->>UI: Update profile preferences
        UI->>API: PATCH /api/v1/users/me
        API-->>UI: Updated profile
        UI->>Store: Replace stored user profile
        UI-->>Driver: Show save result
      end

      Driver->>UI: Log out
      UI->>Store: Clear authentication session
      UI-->>Driver: Return to quick login
    end

    rect rgb(245,250,255)
      Note over Planner,TomTom: 8. Business Planner demand and site feasibility
      Planner->>UI: Open /business-dashboard
      UI->>Store: Read access token

      par Demand/suitability heatmap
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/planner/cells.geojson?bbox&metric=score&weights
        API-->>UI: Cell polygons, scores, truncation metadata
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/planner/predict.area?bbox&limit&top
        API-->>UI: Predictions, suitability bands, model provenance
      and Existing SPKLUs
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/stations?bbox&limit
        API-->>UI: Existing station markers
      and Commercial POIs
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/planner/pois.geojson?bbox&limit
        API-->>UI: POI features and viewport totals
      and Land-use shapes
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/planner/landuse.geojson?bbox&limit
        API-->>UI: Land-use polygons and coverage note
      and Optional traffic layer
        UI->>TomTom: GET live traffic flow tiles
        TomTom-->>UI: Traffic overlay
      end
      UI-->>Planner: Render planning map, legends, and notices

      Planner->>UI: Choose analysis centre and radius
      UI->>API: POST /api/v1/planner/candidates?lat&lon&radius_km&basis=suitability
      API-->>UI: Ranked candidates and applied weights
      UI-->>Planner: Show candidate sites

      Planner->>UI: Select candidate or saved site
      par Evidence and competition
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/planner/cells/{cell_id}
        API-->>UI: Score inputs and spatial evidence
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/planner/benchmark/{cell_id}
        API-->>UI: Nearby competing stations
      and Model prediction
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/planner/predict
        API-->>UI: Cell prediction and model interpretation
      and Bookmark state
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/planner/saved-sites/{cell_id}
        API-->>UI: Saved status
      and Financial scenario
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/planner/roi
        API-->>UI: Revenue, utilisation, payback, assumptions
      end
      UI-->>Planner: Show feasibility, benchmark, and financial tabs

      opt Save or remove a real planning cell
        Planner->>UI: Toggle bookmark
        alt Save
          UI->>API: PUT /api/v1/planner/saved-sites/{cell_id}
          API-->>UI: saved=true
        else Remove
          UI->>API: DELETE /api/v1/planner/saved-sites/{cell_id}
          API-->>UI: saved=false
        end
      end

      Planner->>UI: Open Saved Sites
      UI->>API: GET /api/v1/planner/saved-sites
      API-->>UI: Planner-specific saved-site list
      UI-->>Planner: Show saved sites
    end